(26, 368, N'A solid watch. Not groundbreaking, but well crafted and emotionally honest.'),
(20, 554, N'A bit overlong, but the final act redeems the slower start.'),
(32, 475, N'Visually stunning but emotionally distant -- style over substance here.'),
(63, 373, N'A solid watch. Not groundbreaking, but well crafted and emotionally honest.'),
(14, 616, N'A quiet, understated film that rewards patience.'),
(63, 71, N'Didn''t quite work for me, though I can see why others love it.'),
(55, 399, N'An ambitious project that mostly sticks the landing.'),
(80, 624, N'The dialogue felt stilted in places, but the visuals more than made up for it.'),
(135, 374, N'Great chemistry between the leads carries an otherwise familiar plot.'),
(140, 335, N'The plot felt predictable, but the lead performance carried the film.'),
(3, 571, N'Didn''t quite work for me, though I can see why others love it.'),
(149, 77, N'Left the theater thinking about it for days -- rare for a film like this.'),
(20, 193, N'Great chemistry between the leads carries an otherwise familiar plot.'),
